    q("afiniti-scenario", "easy", ["communication"], "Scenario: your analysis shows the opposite of what your manager expected. How do you present it?", "Check the work again, then present the evidence plainly with the method, limits and what the numbers do and do not show, and discuss possible reasons without defensiveness.", ["Recheck first", "Present evidence clearly", "Discuss limits openly"], ["How do you handle pressure to change the result?"], kind="scenario"),
    q("pandas", "easy", ["pandas"], "What is the difference between loc and iloc in pandas, and what does a boolean mask do?", "loc selects by label and iloc by integer position. A boolean mask is a True/False series used inside brackets or loc to keep only the rows where the condition is true.", ["Label vs position", "Boolean mask filters rows", "Combine conditions with & and |"], ["Why do you need parentheses around each condition?"]),
